codex
The neighbor residual exposed one missing selector fact, not a control issue: it retained the impossible branch where an in-range permutation element is not below the sentinel `N²+1`. I’m adding the exact guarded range selector lemma `gridAt < N²+1` for valid indices. It is a pure data-access consequence of `validPerm`, and it does not bypass any conditional or write.
apply patch
